<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Admin Broadcast is one of the server administration windows. Open it from File > Admin; it opens as a desktop window you can drag, resize, minimize to the taskbar, and close with its title-bar X."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_megaphone}>{dgettext("help_features", "Two reaches")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Wallops goes only to users who opted in with mode +w. Announce goes to everyone connected, whether they asked for it or not — reserve it for things people genuinely need to see."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_features", "Access")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Server operators may send wallops. Announce is administrators only, and the radio is disabled for anyone else. If neither is available the Send button is disabled entirely."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-console">
    {dgettext("help_features", "admin console")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-server-broadcasts">
    {dgettext("help_features", "server broadcasts")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-wallops">{dgettext("help_features", "/wallops")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-announce">{dgettext("help_features", "/announce")}</.help_link>
</p>
